"Fastest cloud service: `anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5` at 19.09s.","Each declared page must succeed before a provider receives a full-document score. Partial outputs remain private and unscored in full-document rankings.","Reference provenance: the existing archived multi-provider consensus is reused byte for byte; it is not independent publisher gold.","Each provider received the same pinned original PNG/JPEG or the declared rendered-PNG baseline variant. Reference text, table cells, manuscript deletions and graph/layout annotations were never sent to providers. Text recognition is scored separately from unavailable cell, branch and page-geometry accuracy.","Accounted prices include settled retry usage and retained uncertain reservations; they are not invoice-reconciled charges. Any held or conservative component makes the price a conservative upper bound.","Supplemental evaluation-diagnostics.json retains punctuation/case/formatting diagnostics separately from lexical-normalized headline WER."],"referenceProvenance":{"kind":"existing-consensus","independentOfProviders":false,"path":"input/examples/document/ocr-categories-efg-run/references/efg-rerun-1-page-newspaper.txt","sha256":"f1ec5da0e74478dc3780965fb1751a32d4eef9ce5147b342fbfbe0a093669da4","sourceUrl":"https://ajc.pics/autoshow/benchmarks/ocr/1-page-newspaper.pdf","sourceRevision":"archived-manifest-sha256:dff1c38447afb1b67b53be8a75f22e910e4130d9e817b808ea9cdcdd70573f4c","description":"Existing archived multi-provider consensus reused byte for byte; this is not independently supplied publisher gold.","evaluationScope":"full-page","serializationPolicy":"Existing agent-authored multi-provider consensus copied byte-for-byte; compare the complete rendered page, preserve old native-PDF run separately.","structureAccuracyAvailable":false,"primaryLexicalAccuracyAvailable":true},"evaluation":{"scope":"full-page","referenceTextScope":"Existing archived multi-provider consensus; not independent publisher gold.","primary